  "description": "The Vitus Zenium is a modern and sporty carbon road bike. Benefitting from the influence of the top-tier Vitus performance bikes and with features that make it a step up from entry level, the Zenium is the bike that will enable you to grow as a rider.\n\nThe Zenium is loaded with great features. Firstly, the carbon frame is UCI-certified so you could, with a bit of training, race it in the Tour de France. Front and rear bolt-thru axles keep the handling predictable and contribute to the responsive feel and efficiency, especially when you are out of the saddle and working hard up the climbs. Dropped seat stays complete the modern look and allow for a touch more comfort through the seatpost on those longer rides. Disc brakes not only equip you with precise control but allow the frame to afford wider tyre clearance of up to 32mm.\n\nThis Zenium model is equipped with Shimano’s tried-and-tested Tiagra mechanical groupset, so you can trust that the gears will be robust and reliable. Cables are routed internally through a neat port in the downtube, protecting them from dirt and prolonging the performance of the components.\n\nThat satisfying and rewarding experience of riding a responsive carbon road bike is where the Zenium excels. It is poised to ignite the two most important qualities of a great ride - exhilaration and fun. Call it your race bike. Call it your sportive bike. Call it your commuter. Call it your all-rounder.\n\nLightweight carbon frame & fork\n\nTapered head tube\n\nInternal cable routing\n\nShimano Tiagra R4700 drivetrain\n\nTRP Spyre disc brakes\n\nVitus wheels and Vee Road Runner 28mm tyres",
